{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55778","headline":"偈颂六首 一 · 神晏","name":"偈颂六首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直下犹难会，寻言转更赊。\n拟（《景德传灯录》卷十八及《五灯会元》卷七作「若」）论佛与祖，特地隔天涯。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"神晏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}